vv`oo..^ooooo^..oo`vv
v`oo...oo+o+oo...oo`v
v1o_.ASo<o+o..S.._o1v
v`oo...oo+o+oo...oo`v
vv`oo..^ooooo^..oo`vv
 v`1oo~!^~?~^!~oo1`v
 vv``oo^~...~^oo``zv
  vv``o~..S..~o``zz
   vz`oo.....oo`zz
    vv`oo$d$oo`zz
     vv1oo_oo1zz
